---
description: Exact counterfactual gate for attributable garden preferences and non-assigned communal duties.
args: { draft: DraftGardenPreference; prepared: PreparedEvidence; decisions: DecisionAtom[] }
returns: Qualification
readout: decision
---
Pass only when member, desired use, availability and stated accessibility need are supported by attributable evidence. Fail when a preference is represented as accepted work or a duty is assigned without explicit consent. Return needs-review when member identity, agreement status, or current source is missing. Return the finite verdict only.
